  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/TemperatureTrendChart.tsx). The
  remainder back the native state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner,
  loading / empty / error chrome) and the chart axis / accessibility summaries.
*/

